      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;changeless-presence&#34;&gt;Changeless Presence&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/discourses/teachers/presence_spira.htm&#34;&gt;TW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Author: Rupert Spira&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0955829054/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/transparency_spira.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/transparency_spira.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;book cover&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The following is an extract from Rupert&amp;rsquo;s book: &amp;lsquo;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0955829054/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;The Transparency of Things:&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Contemplating the Nature of Experience&lt;/a&gt;&amp;rsquo; .&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Purchase from Amazon &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0955829054/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;US&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.co.uk/exec/obidos/ASIN/0955829054/thespiritupat-21&#34;&gt;UK&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://transparencyofthings.rupertspira.com/default.aspx&#34;&gt;Visit Rupert&amp;rsquo;s Website&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;There is something present which is experiencing the current situation. We do not know what that something is, yet we know for certain that it is present, that it is conscious.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We know that it is not the mind, the body or the world, because the mind, the body and the world are part of the current situation that is being experienced.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
